<extrapolations>
# The Legendre coefficients of 13C(a,n)16O[6.13] (the model of tests/angular_coefficients) in the five
# expansions, and dsigma/dOmega at the 24 Gauss-Legendre nodes in cos(theta_cm) (truth.py projects it).
extrapolation leg_a_over_a0
    reaction       13C(a,n)16O[6.12989]
    quantity       legendre
    unit           1
    expansion      a_over_a0
    orders         0 6
    energies       list 5.9 6.1 6.3 MeV lab

